# ⚖️ Sessions vs JWT

| Concept                            | Session                   | JWT                |
| ---------------------------------- | ------------------------- | ------------------ |
| Authentication state               | Server-side               | Token-based        |
| Client carries                     | Session identifier/cookie | JWT                |
| Server stores authentication state | Yes                       | Generally no       |
| Verification                       | Session lookup            | Token verification |
| Example                            | `req.session.user`        | `jwt.verify()`     |
| Project endpoint                   | `/session-protected`      | `/jwt-protected`   |
| Expiration                         | Session configuration     | JWT expiration     |
| Typical approach                   | Stateful                  | Stateless          |

